# MagicSquare Python Code Style

## Must
- Target Python 3.10+ syntax and typing features.
- Follow PEP 8 style rules.
- Keep max line length at 88 (Black-compatible).
- Add type hints to all function/method parameters and return types.
- Add Google-style docstrings to all public classes/functions/methods.
- Use explicit imports; no wildcard imports.

## Must Not
- Do not add untyped public APIs.
- Do not use `Any` unless there is a clear boundary reason.

## Checklist
- `from __future__ import annotations` added when useful.
- Public API has type hints and Google docstrings.
- File remains Black/Ruff compatible.
